    '<span style="color: #b30059; font-weight:700;">non-coding</span> sections of the RNA are removed',
    '<span style="color: #b30059; font-weight:700;">introns</span> of the RNA are removed',
    '<span style="color: #0000b3; font-weight:700;">exons</span> are fused together',
